{"slug":"Murder-Mystery-2-rattex-KEYLESS-231977","_id":"6ac9355227496128b3b4d167","title":"[KEYLESS] rattex MM2","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d5a","gameId":142823291,"name":"Murder Mystery 2","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":142823291},"features":"RATTEX - FEATURE LIST\n\nMAIN\n- Auto Farm: collects coins using straight tween movement at 20 studs/second,\n  with hovering and noclip.\n- Farm Mode: Nearest, Nearest + XP Farm, or Randomize.\n- Automatically Grab Gun: collects the dropped sheriff gun.\n- Auto End Round: performs an action based on your current role.\n- Teleport To Lobby.\n- Teleport To Map.\n\nTARGET\n- Searchable player selection, excluding the local player.\n- Fling Target: direct torso/head contact with high velocity and spin.\n- Spectate Target.\n- Loop Go To Target: continuously follows the selected player.\n- Teleport To Target.\n- Fling Sheriff: also recognizes the Hero/gun holder.\n- Fling Murderer.\n\nMISC\n- Player Chams: outlines other players with no fill.\n  Murderer: red. Sheriff/Hero: blue. Innocent: green. Lobby/no role: white.\n- Gun Cham: blue outline on the dropped gun.\n- 3DRendering: switches off 3D rendering when enabled.\n- Name ESP: uses Roblox's built-in character name labels.\n- Emote selection: ninja, dab, floss, headless, zen, zombie, sit.\n- Auto Emote: plays while idle and blends between movement and emotes.\n\nROLES\n- Kill Aura: knife attacks against nearby players when you are the murderer.\n- Aura Distance: adjustable from 5 to 50 studs.\n- Auto Kill All: repeatedly runs the knife attack against other living players.\n- Silent Aim: redirects gun aim toward the living murderer with movement prediction.\n- Kill Murderer (Blatant): equips the sheriff/Hero gun, locks 3.5 studs behind\n  the murderer, enables Silent Aim and repeatedly shoots.\n- Auto Shoot Murderer.\n- Shoot Murderer: configurable keybind; C by default.\n- Shooting keybind ignores typing in chat and other text boxes.\n\nPLAYER\n- Walk Speed: toggle and slider, 0 to 150.\n- Jump Power: toggle and slider, 0 to 200.\n- Anti Fling.\n\nSETTINGS\n- Auto Save Settings: saves settings to ShraksMM2/autosave.json in the\n  executor workspace and loads them on the next execution.\n- Auto ReExecute: queues the hosted loader for execution after teleporting.\n- Auto Rejoin: is what it is.\n- Rejoin Server.\n- Server Hop: searches for another public server with space.\n- Searchable command selection and Execute Command.\n- Commands: kick yourself, sit, void, anchor, unanchor.\n- UI Transparency.\n- Show User Info.\n\nCOMING SOON...\n- Dodge Thrown Knife.\n- Invisible [FE].\n- Webhook URL field.\n- Coin Tracker.\n- Minutes To Send Webhook field.\n- Unbox Notification.","tags":["mm","keyless","auto farm","aimbot","auto win"],"script":"-- For more free and keyless scripts - https://discord.gg/8CzfZYhsrw\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/imshrak/mm2/refs/heads/main/rattex\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a8d210911d3491d418e7996","username":"ShrakBlox","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/497e5c681b63ab55e0b602c0fc8ce46c4a2a2a14f89c481326f99196d8a27c71.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a8d210911d3491d418e7996-1788339166999.png"},"lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"6a8d210911d3491d418e7996","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"day","rank":7,"period":"day","metric":"executes","value":43546}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.streak","tier":30},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/497e5c681b63ab55e0b602c0fc8ce46c4a2a2a14f89c481326f99196d8a27c71.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a8d210911d3491d418e7996-1788339166999.png"}},"verified":true,"keyless":true,"discord":"https://discord.gg/8CzfZYhsrw","views":9052,"executes":97986,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{